1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Malin Nicodemusdotter, born c. 1624–1627 in Gammelbyn 7, died 1696 in Bergsbyn 7, both villages in Skellefteå parish, Västerbotten (Västerbotten county). (Source: Ulf Lundström (2001), Skellefteå socken 1650–1790.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Buried 18th of July 1696 as "Jon Swens Swärmoder [mother in law] i Bergsbyen". https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/A0014878_00033#?c=&m=&s=&cv=32&xywh=273%2C1285%2C2305%2C1050
2 CONT
2 CONT She probably died in July because the time of death and the time of burial where only a few days in those days, due to the belief that death and burial were closely connected.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her haplogroup has been verified as U8a1a1a. – (Source [https://www.familytreedna.com/public/Skelleftea?iframe=mtresults Skellefteå and nearby parishes] FTDNA group, 12/16/2016) 
