1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Ulf Lundström in Bönder och gårdar, Lasse Östensson is at Falmark 18.
2 CONT "Lasse Östensson owned the homestead 1591-1598. According to Johannes Bureus, he was married to Rådgerd Karlsdotter, a daughter of Karl Mosesson at Bureå no. 8. Lasse Östensson was probably a son of Östen Clemetsson at Falmark no.
2 CONC  1. Lasse Östensson and Rådgerd had the children Clemet Larsson in Falmark, Kälug who was married to Nils Hansson in Bureå, Anna who was married to Jon Jakobsson Tailor in Uppsala, Per, Karl, Nils, Moses and Margareta.
2 CONT Lasse Östensson was in the village as early as 1577, according to the register of young men "
